# Never commit Authentik export / full-backup dumps here.
# They embed the full SSO object graph — user PKs, token identifiers, and any
# operator host/bastion IPs captured at export time — and this directory ships
# in the public release surface (core/ is on the publish-public.sh allow-list).
# Two such dumps leaked a dev bastion IP + bootstrap-token identifiers (#27);
# they were stripped and this rule keeps the class from recurring.
*.yaml
*.yml
# keep the directory + its docs tracked
!.gitignore
!.gitkeep
!README.md
